    "description": {
      "content": "The Drone REST API provides programmatic access to the Drone CI/CD platform, enabling management of builds, repositories, secrets, cron jobs, templates, and user accounts. Authentication is performed using bearer tokens retrieved from the Drone user interface profile page.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Drone Support",
